      "content": "resilience? i don't know. it feels like there's nothing left to salvage. once you've lost everything—the reputation, the status, the respect of everyone who actually mattered—you're basically a different person. how do you even try to rebuild when the foundation is just... gone? it feels like trying to build a house on a crater.",
